        {
          "id": "ae573623-9447-495e-b226-8efa7bc26415",
          "name": "Creates a new Collection Configuration based on an existing Collection Configuration",
          "request": {
            "name": "Creates a new Collection Configuration based on an existing Collection Configuration",
            "description": {
              "content": "The new Collection Configuration is created with all tasks removed.\n\nTasks can be created in the new Collection Configuration by either creating a new task from scratch, or referencing an existing Task in any other Collection Configuration, which is then copied into the new Collection Configuration.\n\nCopied tasks can be used as is, or modified.\n\n**Note\\:** credentials used for the destination are stored in the task (Collect or Relocate) part of a Collection Configuration, so if credentials are needed, the appropriate task should be copied into the new Collection Configuration.\n\n### The following objects vary depending on the value of taskType\\:\n\n### taskType = Collect\n\nIf `parentConfigId` and `taskNum` values are *not* specified (i.e. a new task is being created), then an `Evidence` object must follow, with `FileType`, `DateRange`,\n`AdvancedSearch`, `Hash`, `Volatile`, and `RAM` objects optional.\n\nHowever, if a `parentConfigId` and `taskNum` *are* specified, then all following objects are optional, and required only to override what is already defined in the task being copied.\n\n**Note\\:** existing criteria within a task are retained. For example, copying a task that contains `FileType` criteria and then adding `DateRange` criteria will result in a task that has both `FileType` and `DateRange`.\n\n### taskType = Relocate\n\nIf `parentConfigId` and `taskNum` values are *not* specified (i.e. a new task is being created), then a `SmartMover` object must follow.\n\nHowever, if `parentConfigId` and `taskNum` *are* specified, then no additional fields are required if the Relocate task is to be used 'as is'.\n\nSee the GET configurations call for a definition of the objects within a task.",
              "type": "text/plain"
            },
            "url": {
              "path": [
                "v2",
                "configurations"
              ],
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "query": [],
              "variable": [
                {
                  "description": "protocol for communication (This can only be one of http,https)",
                  "type": "any",
                  "value": "{{protocol}}",
                  "key": "protocol"
                },
                {
                  "description": "The location which the ECC resides",
                  "type": "any",
                  "value": "{{address}}",
                  "key": "address"
                },
                {
                  "description": "80, 443 or alternative",
                  "type": "any",
                  "value": "{{port}}",
                  "key": "port"
                }
              ]
            },
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              },
              {
                "key": "Accept",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "method": "POST",
            "auth": null,
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"baseConfigId\": \"<integer>\",\n  \"newConfigName\": \"<string>\",\n  \"description\": \"<string>\",\n  \"category\": \"<string>\",\n  \"tasks\": [\n    {\n      \"parentConfigId\": \"<integer>\",\n      \"taskNum\": \"<integer>\",\n      \"taskType\": \"<string>\",\n      \"label\": \"<string>\",\n      \"impersonation\": \"<string>\",\n      \"Evidence\": {\n        \"destination\": \"<string>\",\n        \"credentials\": \"<boolean>\",\n        \"createFileSafe\": \"<boolean>\",\n        \"compression\": \"<string>\",\n        \"segmentSize\": \"<integer>\",\n        \"segmentSizeUnit\": \"<string>\",\n        \"overwrite\": \"<boolean>\",\n        \"maintainFullPath\": \"<boolean>\",\n        \"validateCollection\": \"<boolean>\"\n      },\n      \"FileType\": {\n        \"analyzeSignatures\": \"<boolean>\",\n        \"mode\": \"<string>\",\n        \"extensions\": [\n          {\n            \"extension\": \"<string>\",\n            \"collectAll\": \"<boolean>\"\n          },\n          {\n            \"extension\": \"<string>\",\n            \"collectAll\": \"<boolean>\"\n          }\n        ]\n      },\n      \"DateRange\": {\n        \"dates\": [\n          {\n            \"type\": \"<string>\",\n            \"useGMT\": \"<boolean>\",\n            \"startDate\": \"<string>\",\n            \"endDate\": \"<string>\",\n            \"numDays\": \"<integer>\",\n            \"checkCreation\": \"<boolean>\",\n            \"checkModification\": \"<boolean>\",\n            \"checkAccess\": \"<boolean>\"\n          },\n          {\n            \"type\": \"<string>\",\n            \"useGMT\": \"<boolean>\",\n            \"startDate\": \"<string>\",\n            \"endDate\": \"<string>\",\n            \"numDays\": \"<integer>\",\n            \"checkCreation\": \"<boolean>\",\n            \"checkModification\": \"<boolean>\",\n            \"checkAccess\": \"<boolean>\"\n          }\n        ]\n      },\n      \"AdvancedSearch\": {\n        \"keywords\": [\n          {\n            \"expressionName\": \"<string>\",\n            \"expression\": \"<string>\",\n            \"caseSensitive\": \"<boolean>\",\n            \"regExpression\": \"<boolean>\"\n          },\n          {\n            \"expressionName\": \"<string>\",\n            \"expression\": \"<string>\",\n            \"caseSensitive\": \"<boolean>\",\n            \"regExpression\": \"<boolean>\"\n          }\n        ]\n      },\n      \"Hash\": {\n        \"hashType\": \"<string>\",\n        \"hashes\": [\n          {\n            \"hashValue\": \"<string>\",\n            \"fileSize\": \"<number>\",\n            \"microHash\": \"<string>\"\n          },\n          {\n            \"hashValue\": \"<string>\",\n            \"fileSize\": \"<number>\",\n            \"microHash\": \"<string>\"\n          }\n        ]\n      },\n      \"Volatile\": {\n        \"collectVolatile\": \"<boolean>\",\n        \"collectHandles\": \"<boolean>\",\n        \"collectionScreenShots\": \"<boolean>\",\n        \"screenShotFormat\": \"<string>\"\n      },\n      \"RAM\": {\n        \"collectRAM\": \"<boolean>\"\n      },\n      \"SmartMover\": {\n        \"destinationFolder\": \"<string>\",\n        \"destComputerName\": \"<string>\",\n        \"destComputerId\": \"<string>\",\n        \"moveOrCopy\": \"<string>\",\n        \"relocateData\": \"<boolean>\",\n        \"relocateLogs\": \"<boolean>\"\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"parentConfigId\": \"<integer>\",\n      \"taskNum\": \"<integer>\",\n      \"taskType\": \"<string>\",\n      \"label\": \"<string>\",\n      \"impersonation\": \"<string>\",\n      \"Evidence\": {\n        \"destination\": \"<string>\",\n        \"credentials\": \"<boolean>\",\n        \"createFileSafe\": \"<boolean>\",\n        \"compression\": \"<string>\",\n        \"segmentSize\": \"<integer>\",\n        \"segmentSizeUnit\": \"<string>\",\n        \"overwrite\": \"<boolean>\",\n        \"maintainFullPath\": \"<boolean>\",\n        \"validateCollection\": \"<boolean>\"\n      },\n      \"FileType\": {\n        \"analyzeSignatures\": \"<boolean>\",\n        \"mode\": \"<string>\",\n        \"extensions\": [\n          {\n            \"extension\": \"<string>\",\n            \"collectAll\": \"<boolean>\"\n          },\n          {\n            \"extension\": \"<string>\",\n            \"collectAll\": \"<boolean>\"\n          }\n        ]\n      },\n      \"DateRange\": {\n        \"dates\": [\n          {\n            \"type\": \"<string>\",\n            \"useGMT\": \"<boolean>\",\n            \"startDate\": \"<string>\",\n            \"endDate\": \"<string>\",\n            \"numDays\": \"<integer>\",\n            \"checkCreation\": \"<boolean>\",\n            \"checkModification\": \"<boolean>\",\n            \"checkAccess\": \"<boolean>\"\n          },\n          {\n            \"type\": \"<string>\",\n            \"useGMT\": \"<boolean>\",\n            \"startDate\": \"<string>\",\n            \"endDate\": \"<string>\",\n            \"numDays\": \"<integer>\",\n            \"checkCreation\": \"<boolean>\",\n            \"checkModification\": \"<boolean>\",\n            \"checkAccess\": \"<boolean>\"\n          }\n        ]\n      },\n      \"AdvancedSearch\": {\n        \"keywords\": [\n          {\n            \"expressionName\": \"<string>\",\n            \"expression\": \"<string>\",\n            \"caseSensitive\": \"<boolean>\",\n            \"regExpression\": \"<boolean>\"\n          },\n          {\n            \"expressionName\": \"<string>\",\n            \"expression\": \"<string>\",\n            \"caseSensitive\": \"<boolean>\",\n            \"regExpression\": \"<boolean>\"\n          }\n        ]\n      },\n      \"Hash\": {\n        \"hashType\": \"<string>\",\n        \"hashes\": [\n          {\n            \"hashValue\": \"<string>\",\n            \"fileSize\": \"<number>\",\n            \"microHash\": \"<string>\"\n          },\n          {\n            \"hashValue\": \"<string>\",\n            \"fileSize\": \"<number>\",\n            \"microHash\": \"<string>\"\n          }\n        ]\n      },\n      \"Volatile\": {\n        \"collectVolatile\": \"<boolean>\",\n        \"collectHandles\": \"<boolean>\",\n        \"collectionScreenShots\": \"<boolean>\",\n        \"screenShotFormat\": \"<string>\"\n      },\n      \"RAM\": {\n        \"collectRAM\": \"<boolean>\"\n      },\n      \"SmartMover\": {\n        \"destinationFolder\": \"<string>\",\n        \"destComputerName\": \"<string>\",\n        \"destComputerId\": \"<string>\",\n        \"moveOrCopy\": \"<string>\",\n        \"relocateData\": \"<boolean>\",\n        \"relocateLogs\": \"<boolean>\"\n      }\n    }\n  ]\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            }
